      "content": "wait really?? i dont know... i feel like im just super dehydrated and jet lagged. it's a long flight and i barely drank anything. i dont want to go to the er just for a leg cramp and being tired, it seems like a huge overkill and so expensive. can't i just take some ibuprofen and sleep it off? what if it's just a muscle strain?",
